  translation {
    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n2:12 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n4:27 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n6:42 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n9:12 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station to Union Station Track 11\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n3:11 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n5:26 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n7:56 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n10:25 pm from Union Station Track 12 to Ridgegate Parkway Station"
